Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:54:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat: an opt-in ? control on the dock for hover help

The dock component "help" draws a ? cell. A click turns hover help on or
off, as Ctrl+b h does, and the cell is lit while hover help is on: on the
accent ground, and in reverse video at 16 colours. It is in no default
list; a [dock] list that names "help" draws it. Hovering it with hover help
on explains it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
